MatrixProblems
================

This directory contains code for reading matrix-market-format matrices and 
vectors and then solve the systems formed by these matrices and vectors. 


How to compile:
===============

mkdir build;
cd build;

cmake -DBOOST_INCLUDEDIR=$BOOST_INCLUDEDIR -DBOOST_LIBRARYDIR=$BOOST_LIBRARYDIR -DBoost_NO_SYSTEM_PATHS=ON -DBoost_NO_BOOST_CMAKE=ON -DZOLTAN_INCLUDE_DIRS=$ZOLTAN_INCLUDEDIR -DSuiteSparse_INCLUDE_DIRS=$SUITESPARSE_ROOT/include -DSuiteSparse_LIBRARIES=$SUITESPARSE_ROOT/lib/libsuitesparseconfig.so -DSUITESPARSE_CONFIG_LIB=$SUITESPARSE_ROOT/lib/libsuitesparseconfig.so -DSUITESPARSE_INCLUDE_DIR=$SUITESPARSE_ROOT/include -DZOLTAN_LIBRARIES=$ZOLTAN_LIBRARYDIR/libzoltan.a -DMETIS_ROOT=$METIS_ROOT -DPARMETIS_INCLUDE_DIR=$PARMETIS_ROOT/include -DPARMETIS_LIBRARY=$PARMETIS_ROOT/lib/libparmetis.so -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS="-O2 -mavx -funroll-loops " ../;

make -j #num-threads

Dependencies:
=======================


This project depends on code from the OPM initiative reservoir simulator Flow (https://opm-project.org/). Currently suports only: Release 2024.10

The following dependencies of flow are also needed:
DUNE (Release 2.9.1+)
Zoltan
Suitesparse
Parmetis
Boost
openmpi

Copy missing header files to Flow instalation folder
====================================================
This project uses the following header files not included in the flow installation folder:
opm/simulators/linalg/MILU.hpp
opm/simulators/linalg/PreconditionerFactory_impl.hpp
opm/simulators/linalg/PressureBhpTransferPolicy.hpp
opm/simulators/linalg/PreconditionerFactoryGPUIncludeWrapper.hpp
opm/simulators/utils/ParallelCommunication.hpp

These files that can be found in the opm-simulators repo must be added to your $FLOW_ROOT/include directory.